abstract: >-
  A Germany-focused, evidence-based and falsifiable policy model linking
  security, diplomacy, energy, migration, social policy and infrastructure.
  The model tests a strategy based on credible deterrence, independent
  European diplomacy, verifiable de-escalation, conditional economic
  normalisation, energy diversification and labour-market integration.
